{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221102001:0":{"text":"Why do those glimmerblooms have their eyes glued at the sea? Is there something there?","source_cn":"奇怪，那两只荧荧花怎么一直盯着海面？是有什么东西吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D202C1ED2BB0ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1221103001:1":{"text":"Something shiny! In the sea!","source_cn":"海面有，亮晶晶的，东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B93182F7DC328B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221103002:1":{"text":"Eh? There really is something shiny in the water. Did you drop it?","source_cn":"咦？海面上真的有个闪闪发光的东西。是你们掉的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507C69424D05A921","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221103003:1":{"text":"No, it drifted over here. From somewhere really far away!","source_cn":"不是。它从——很远很远，漂过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C9556DB92C37989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221103004:1":{"text":"Drifted over? Could it be a floating bottle?","source_cn":"漂过来的？难道是漂流瓶之类的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94DCFEBEB66654B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221103005:1":{"text":"A lot of good stuff! In the bottle!","source_cn":"瓶子，很多！里面，会有好东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D562E1DF41FA591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221103006:1":{"text":"I want it! But can't reach it...","source_cn":"荧荧花，喜欢！可是，拿不到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042B4944CEE0F76D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221103007:1":{"text":"A floating bottle is a rare find. I wonder what's inside...","source_cn":"居然会有漂流瓶漂到这里，真是难得一见。不知道瓶子里会装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31CAFA6D14724794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221103008:1":{"text":"Magister, should we fish it out and take a look?","source_cn":"主人，我们要不要把它捞上来看看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FA03CD637FA24D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, should we fish it out and take a look?","female":"Magister, should we fish it out and take a look?","variant_male_record_index":"133078","variant_female_record_index":"133079","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221103009:1":{"text":"But we don't have anything to fish it out with...","source_cn":"可我们手头也没有打捞工具呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE3265B608634F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221103010:1":{"text":"There are... some torn <style=\"highlight\">fishing nets</style> nearby! You can... piece them together!","source_cn":"附近，有<style=highlight>渔网</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC65B9E6CDA283D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1221103011:1":{"text":"We can do that?! Then what are we waiting for? Let's make a big net right away!","source_cn":"还可以这样！？那我们还等什么，赶紧拼张大网出来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF455154A1D67BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蓝叶荧荧花":{"text":"Blue Leaf Bloom","source":"蓝叶荧荧花","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:绿叶荧荧花":{"text":"Green Leaf Bloom","source":"绿叶荧荧花","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221104001:0":{"text":"This should be large enough. Let's see if we can fish out the bottle.","source_cn":"这张网应该够大了，试试看能不能把漂流瓶捞上来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F06D71A450AD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211050.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1221105001:1":{"text":"There's a letter inside! With a boy's wish! Does the sea really grant wishes?","source_cn":"漂流瓶里居然是一封许愿信！\\n大海真的会实现这些心愿吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56029AA0AC2632F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221105002:1":{"text":"Most tales about kids having their wishes come true if they behave are made up by adults.","source_cn":"大部分让小孩乖乖听话，等待心愿被实现的故事，都是大人编...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF79C6A906E3A76A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221105003:1":{"text":"Still, my heart aches for the boy who penned this letter... Navigating through the fog is no simple task. His father and brother might never make it home...","source_cn":"不过，写这封信的小男孩也好可怜……在迷雾中探索航道可不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A97904CCBEED261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221105004:1":{"text":"Chippy thinks so too...\nHow about we fulfill his wish?","source_cn":"满满也这样觉得……\\n要不，我们来帮他实现愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956067DE60DCC52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1221105004":{"text":"Chippy thinks so too...\nHow about we fulfill his wish?","source_cn":"满满也这样觉得……\\n要不，我们来帮他实现愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956067DE60DCC52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221105005:1":{"text":"That's right! Protecting a child's dream is part of my duty as a knight!","source_cn":"没错！骑士也应该守护孩子们的童真美梦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA3F01453AB9E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221105006:1":{"text":"We can easily catch a <style=\"highlight\">rainbow snapper</style>, but we need to make sure he doesn't know it's from us.","source_cn":"钓一条<style=highlight>幻彩鲷</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12D4CAD71F948816","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221105007:1":{"text":"Hmm... Maybe we could put the fish inside the floating bottle and leave it on his doorstep. That way, he'll think that his wish has been granted by the sea!","source_cn":"嗯……也许可以把幻彩鲷装在漂流瓶里，放到他家门口。这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B773C3699DB6411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221105008:1":{"text":"That's brilliant! Chippy, you've gotten smarter!","source_cn":"这个办法不错！满满，你变聪明了~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD78E833D37C0FF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"It's a good idea.","source_cn":"是个好主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC2288D658FE2E65F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a good idea.","female":"It's a good idea.","variant_male_record_index":"65980","variant_female_record_index":"65981","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"Do you want to get him a rainbow snapper?","source_cn":"你想送一条幻彩鲷给他？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6D7B2A8B5777F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Do you want to get him a rainbow snapper?","female":"Do you want to get him a rainbow snapper?","variant_male_record_index":"65982","variant_female_record_index":"65983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211060.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221106001:0":{"text":"This area is the habitat of rainbow snapper. Let's see if we can catch one here.","source_cn":"幻彩鲷就生活在这片海域里，我们在附近试试看能不能钓上来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A38A7EC0869228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211070.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221107001:0":{"text":"Magister, see what Chippy's found—a gorgeous shell!","source_cn":"主人，你看，满满捡到了一个好漂亮的贝壳！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x499C70ACAD1B0537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, see what Chippy's found—a gorgeous shell!","female":"Magister, see what Chippy's found—a gorgeous shell!","variant_male_record_index":"133094","variant_female_record_index":"133095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1221107002:0":{"text":"This is odd... There are so many shells here, but there's not a sign of rainbow snapper.","source_cn":"好奇怪……这里的贝壳好多，但完全没有幻彩鲷的踪影。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80BDCF7B7A0906EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1221107003:0":{"text":"How about we ask the glimmerblooms? We can offer them the shells Chippy found to thank them!","source_cn":"要不然去问问荧荧花吧？顺便把满满捡到的贝壳送给它们当作感谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB2C9EFC6EEC617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211080.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1221108001:1":{"text":"Glimmerblooms, do you happen to know where we can catch some rainbow snapper?","source_cn":"荧荧花，你们知道哪里有幻彩鲷吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7B6C338B7B1F87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221108002:1":{"text":"We've been fishing here for a while and still haven't spotted a single rainbow snapper...","source_cn":"我们在这里钓了好久，也没看见半只幻彩鲷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E8DBCEE4AFD737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221108003:1":{"text":"North! West! There's an island!","source_cn":"西边、北边！有小岛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA044B308EED3FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221108004:1":{"text":"Do you mean the rainbow snapper all gather around <style=\"highlight\">an island in the northwest</style>?","source_cn":"唔，意思是，幻彩鲷都聚集在<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99B55165A95EE215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221108005:1":{"text":"Yup! Yup!","source_cn":"嗯，嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B7ED809C6640E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221108006:1":{"text":"I see! Thank you so much! We would like you to have this beautiful shell!","source_cn":"原来如此！谢谢你们，这个好看的贝壳就请当作谢礼收下吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC69A33A529883E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221108007:1":{"text":"No big deal! The shell! We love it!","source_cn":"不谢！不用谢！贝壳——喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F5C0FA3ADF0617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蓝叶荧荧花":{"text":"Blue Leaf Bloom","source":"蓝叶荧荧花","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211090.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221109001:0":{"text":"So all the rainbow snapper have gone to that island. No wonder there's none here.","source_cn":"原来幻彩鲷都游去西北边的小岛上了，难怪这里看不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE694F995E40C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1221109002:0":{"text":"Magister, let's head over there and try again!","source_cn":"主人，我们去那边再试试看吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A76C2814869D3AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, let's head over there and try again!","female":"Magister, let's head over there and try again!","variant_male_record_index":"133106","variant_female_record_index":"133107","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211100.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211100","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221110001:0":{"text":"This should be the spot the glimmerblooms mentioned. Let's see if we can catch some rainbow snapper here!","source_cn":"这里应该就是荧荧花说的幻彩鲷聚集点了。试试看能不能钓到吧~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41EC964A309CF955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211110.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1221111001:1":{"text":"Wow, this one's so pretty!","source_cn":"哇，这条幻彩鲷好漂亮呀~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1035FB1E16F42887","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"Rainbow Snapper","source_cn":"幻彩鲷","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4A9487199EA924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221111002:1":{"text":"I'm sure Almer will be over the moon when he sees it!","source_cn":"写信的安尔姆收到这份礼物，一定会很高兴的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23667A4C3E45F7C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221111003:1":{"text":"Into the bottle it goes! Now, we just need to leave it at Almer's doorstep.","source_cn":"满满把它装到漂流瓶里了！接下来只要把它送到那个小男孩家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE0A1CE10CB63DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221111004:1":{"text":"According to the address on the letter, Almer lives in the <style=\"highlight\">southern outskirts of Rustport</style>. I guess his house is one of the several in that area.","source_cn":"我记得，安尔姆的信上写着地址，是<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82BE42E9645870E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221111005:1":{"text":"We can ask around when we get there.","source_cn":"具体是哪一户，等我们过去了再问问附近的人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722A34434199C354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211120.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1221112001:0":{"text":"Let's ask that elderly lady over there if she knows where Almer lives.","source_cn":"前面有位老婆婆，我们去问问她知不知道安尔姆家在哪吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEB238D4C1693092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12211130.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211130","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1221113001:1":{"text":"Madam, do you know where Almer lives?","source_cn":"婆婆，请问你知道安尔姆家在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x309B9CF53143B8CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221113002:1":{"text":"Oh, you're looking for little Almer! Just head toward the bridge. The <style=\"highlight\">house to the north of the bridge</style> is where he stays.","source_cn":"哦，小安尔姆啊！你们沿着路往木桥的方向走，<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E0A094783113C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221113003:0":{"text":"Are you his friends, or are you here to deliver a message?","source_cn":"你们是他的朋友？还是来送信的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D24C10A9A2A4DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221113004:1":{"text":"Well, we received a letter from him. I suppose we're his friends.","source_cn":"唔……我们收到了他写的信，应该算是他的朋友吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9740E097DC1693E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221113005:1":{"text":"It's good as long as you aren't here to deliver bad news...","source_cn":"那就好，只要不是送来噩耗就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36CFD58463049789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1221113005":{"text":"It's good as long as you aren't here to deliver bad news...","source_cn":"那就好，只要不是送来噩耗就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36CFD58463049789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221113006:1":{"text":"Almer's father and brother have been out at sea for almost a year, and his mother, Giovanni, is in poor health. I'm always worried about them.","source_cn":"小安尔姆的爸爸和哥哥出海快一年了，一直没回来。他妈妈乔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC9607AACBD22AA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221113007:1":{"text":"As long as it isn't bad news, I'm relieved! At this point, no news is good news for Almer and his mother.","source_cn":"没有噩耗就好！现在对他们来说，没有消息就是好消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x556F2B4DD68D9097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Bad news?","source_cn":"噩耗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD151379288EE4B7D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Bad news?","female":"Bad news?","variant_male_record_index":"65984","varian