,"source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/timeline/quest_story/12211170.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12211170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116001:":{"text":"Oh? What a beautiful fish!","source_cn":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD237F994AAAA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116002:":{"text":"Is this... a rainbow snapper?!","source_cn":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3AAF2745AF994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116003:":{"text":"Mother! Come and take a look!","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈，你快来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00E08F44398F1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221117001:1":{"text":"Look at this beautiful fish!","source_cn":"妈妈，你看——！好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBB24BBA7AEEEEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221117002:1":{"text":"I—Is this a rainbow snapper?! This kind of fish should only be found on the islands. How did it end up here?","source_cn":"这……这是是幻彩鲷？！可这种鱼应该只有海岛上才有，怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1875D87B8628091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221117003:1":{"text":"The sea has granted my wish!","source_cn":"——是大海实现了我的愿望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9CB4E169C0B52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221117004:1":{"text":"...The sea?","source_cn":"……大海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FCDF3B3CFA5F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221117005:1":{"text":"Yes! Father said the sea would make my wish come true if I behaved and didn't cause any trouble.","source_cn":"嗯！爸爸说过，只要我乖乖听话，不给你添麻烦，大海就会实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB187068D8256D71A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221117006:1":{"text":"I've notice you've been sighing a lot lately, so I secretly wrote a wish letter hoping the sea would send me a rainbow snapper. Father told me it was his gift to you when he proposed.","source_cn":"妈妈最近总是叹气，所以我偷偷写了一封许愿信，希望大海能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF1C36D4D59D7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221117007:1":{"text":"I wanted to cheer you up. I'm sure Father and my brother would want the same!","source_cn":"妈妈，安尔姆希望你能开心一点，爸爸和哥哥肯定也是这么想的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3EBBD26B9D2D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221117008:1":{"text":"Don't worry. They're the best sailors in Rustport. They'll definitely come home!","source_cn":"别担心了，他们可是最厉害的引航员，一定会平安回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2E6A1A8FDF08E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221117009:1":{"text":"You're such a good boy... I promise I'll pull myself together.","source_cn":"好……乖孩子，不愧是我的小安尔姆。妈妈知道了，妈妈……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410243720DC3C607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221117010:1":{"text":"Shall we keep the fish? This would be my second time having this fish as a pet.","source_cn":"我们去把幻彩鲷养起来吧？这还是妈妈第二次养这种鱼呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2720E7B53DF38BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1221117011:1":{"text":"Let's do it! Father's going to be so happy when he comes home and sees the fish!","source_cn":"嗯！等爸爸回来看到了，肯定会很高兴的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh